 34P     18O(18O,PNG) E=34 MEV         2009CH43                  ENSDF    202609
 34P   H TYP=FUL$AUT=LIJIE SUN AND JUN CHEN$CIT=ENSDF$CUT=30-Sep-2026$          
 34P   H TYP=FUL$AUT=NINEL NICA, BALRAJ SINGH$CIT=NDS 113, 1563 (2012)$         
 34P 2 H CUT=28-May-2012$                                                       
 34P  c  2009Ch43, 2010Gh02: a 34-MeV {+18}O beam was provided from the 14 UD   
 34P 2c  BARC-TIFR Pelletron facility at TIFR, Mumbai. The target was           
 34P 3c  1.6-mg/cm{+2} {+18}O on both sides of a 50-mg/cm{+22} Ta foil. The     
 34P 4c  deexciting |g rays were detected by an array of seven                  
 34P 5c  Compton-suppressed Clover Ge detectors placed at 30|', 60|', 90|',     
 34P 6c  120|', and 150|'. Measured E|g, I|g, |g|g, |g|g(|q)(DCO), and          
 34P 7c  |g|g(|q)(POL). Deduced levels, J, |p, and |g-ray multipolarities.      
 34P 8c  Comparisons with shell-model calculations.                             
 34P  cG E,RI$From 2009Ch43.                                                    
 34P  cG M$From measured |g|g(|q)(DCO) and |g|g(|q)(POL). Expected R{-DCO}      
 34P 2cG values in a stretched quadrupole gate are R{-DCO}(Q)|?1 for stretched  
 34P 3cG quadrupole (|DJ=2) or unstretched dipole (|DJ=0) transitions;          
 34P 4cG R{-DCO}(Q)|?0.5 for stretched dipole (|DJ=1) transitions. Expected     
 34P 5cG R{-DCO} values in a stretched dipole gate are R{-DCO}(D)|?1 for        
 34P 6cG stretched dipole (|DJ=1) transitions; R{-DCO}(D)|?2 for stretched      
 34P 7cG quadrupole (|DJ=2) or unstretched dipole (|DJ=0) transitions. A        
 34P 8cG positive POL indicates an electric type transition, and a negative POL 
 34P 9cG indicates a magnetic type transition. DCO and POL values are provided  
 34P AcG in an e-mail reply to B. Singh from the first author of 2009Ch43 on    
 34P BcG Sept 14, 2009.                                                         
 34P  cL E$From a least-squares fit to the measured |g-ray energies.            
 34P  cL J$As given in 2009Ch43. When considered in the Adopted Levels, the firm
 34P 2cL assignments here are placed within parentheses if there are no other   
 34P 3cL strong arguments to support these firm assignments.                    
